00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.340
They don't even know if this person exists.

512
00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:14.820
Yeah.

513
00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:16.980
And they bicker about Denny's and IHOP.

514
00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:18.600
They bicker about the clouds.

515
00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:20.520
Dwight says, get your clouds right.

516
00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:21.880
Michael tells them to shut up.

517
00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:25.380
But I have a background catch.

518
00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:26.300
What is it?

519
00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:29.440
Oh, it sent me down a Google path, Jenna.

